			"notes": "## Port to Minecraft 1.21.10\n\n### Changes\n- Update dependencies: Fabric API 0.138.4, NeoForge 21.10.64\n- Update Architectury Loom to 1.13-SNAPSHOT\n- Backport API changes from upstream sgui 1.21.11:\n  - GameProfile API: `getId()` -> `id()`, `getName()` -> `name()`\n  - ResolvableProfile: use factory methods instead of constructors\n  - PropertyMap: use ImmutableMultimap in constructor\n  - Add `setProfile(GameProfile)` method, deprecate `setSkullOwner` with server param\n\n### Downloads\n- **Fabric**: `sgui-1.9.1+1.21.10-fabric.jar`\n- **NeoForge**: `sgui-1.9.1+1.21.10-neoforge.jar`\n\nAlso available on [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/sgui/versions?g=1.21.10)"
		},
